ines and aftermarket components for the commercial aircraft engines. It also engages in the offshore energy business, which consists of vessels and equipment that support offshore oil and gas activities and production. FTAI Aviation Ltd. has a strategic collaboration with Aeronautical Engineers, Inc. The company was founded in 2011 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"7350","sic_desc":"Services-Miscellaneous Equipment Rental & Leasing","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","mcap":17350307840,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"NEW YORK, NY","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1590364,"massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-09-30","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":291096000.0,"rev_yoy":26.4,"eps":0.33,"eps_yoy":-99.9,"ni":41307000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":14.2,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":312737000.0,"rev_yoy":14.0,"eps":1.09,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":118360000.0,"ni_yoy":341.6,"nm":37.8,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":326694000.0,"rev_yoy":11.6,"eps":0.31,"eps_yoy":40.9,"ni":39622000.0,"ni_yoy":34.8,"nm":12.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":443594000.0,"rev_yoy":61.7,"eps":-2.26,"eps_yoy":-591.3,"ni":-219870000.0,"ni_yoy":-501.6,"nm":-49.6,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-30","rev":465794000.0,"rev_yoy":60.0,"eps":0.76,"eps_yoy":130.3,"ni":86482000.0,"ni_yoy":109.4,"nm":18.6,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-12-31","rev":498819000.0,"rev_yoy":59.5,"eps":0.85,"eps_yoy":-22.0,"ni":102448000.0,"ni_yoy":-13.4,"nm":20.5,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2025-03-31","rev":502080000.0,"rev_yoy":53.7,"eps":0.87,"eps_yoy":180.6,"ni":102386000.0,"ni_yoy":158.4,"nm":20.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{